  "description": "<p>Welcome to Rocky's Famous Treats, where every bite is a celebration of your dog's health and happiness. As passionate pet parents ourselves, we understand the challenges of finding treats that are not only delicious but also safe and wholesome. That&rsquo;s why we specialize in natural dog treats made from single and limited ingredients, ensuring that even the pickiest eaters and those with sensitive stomachs can enjoy a tasty reward without worry.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Our mission is simple: to provide trustworthy, high-quality treats that you can feel good about giving to your furry companions. Each product is crafted with love and care, utilizing only the finest natural ingredients, so you can rest assured that your pup is receiving the best. Our treats are more than just snacks; they&rsquo;re a commitment to your dog's well-being and a promise to enhance their tail-wagging moments.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>Join us on this journey to delight your four-legged friends with treats that are as pure and genuine as the love you share. Rocky's Famous Treats&mdash;where every tail wags for a reason!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Current Treats:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Blueberry Apple dog biscut treats</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Peanut Butter Banana biscut treats</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Dehyrdated Chicken Feet</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Dehyrdated Rabbit Ears</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Dehyrdrated Rabbit Feet</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Limited Ingredients and Single Ingredients, Veteran Owned &amp; Operated, Handcrafted Treats&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">15% commission sales via paypal or card&nbsp;</p>",
